Package: TTM
Type: Package
Title: Terminal Trend Models on the Retrospective Time Scale
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Tingchang",
           family = "Wang",
           role = "aut",
           email = "twang5@ufl.edu"),
    person(given = "Zhigang",
           family = "Li",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "zhigang.li@ufl.edu")
    )
Description: Fits retrospective-time longitudinal models for terminal trend
    analysis using weighted generalized estimating equations and related joint
    modeling tools. The package provides functions to estimate spline-based
    baseline and treatment effect trajectories on the retrospective time scale,
    obtain pointwise confidence intervals, and visualize fitted trajectories.
